WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:16.975
Chuck: Do you think the ants know what we did with the magnifying glass?

2
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:18.515
Dave: What do you mean?

3
00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:25.218
Chuck: Remember, we used the sun's rays to burn little ants─ Dave: Be quiet!

4
00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:28.300
If they don't know, we don't want them to find out.

5
00:00:33.672 --> 00:00:35.033
Ant 1: Into the ground, humans!

6
00:00:36.074 --> 00:00:36.414
Dave: No way.

7
00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:41.038
Ant 2: We paid the mites a lot of money for you.

8
00:00:41.758 --> 00:00:42.859
Climb into the hole!

9
00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:46.442
Chuck: I won't take orders from an ant!

10
00:00:46.602 --> 00:00:55.268
Ant 3: You are too little to challenge us.

11
00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:57.390
Ant 2: You will do what we say!

12
00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.732
Chuck Dave: Okay.

13
00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:07.450
Chuck: I think this hole leads to where the ants live.

14
00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:11.253
Dave: First the mites captured us, now the ants.

15
00:01:12.174 --> 00:01:14.036
It's not fun being a slave.

16
00:01:15.757 --> 00:01:17.438
Chuck: What if they never let us out?

17
00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:19.960
Dave: I don't want to think about it!

18
00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.892
I can’t believe we’re trapped here.

19
00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:38.242
Chuck: It's because of Danny and Brad and that stupid toy gun.

20
00:01:38.262 --> 00:01:44.944
Dave: I never thought I would say this, but I hope Danny [n3@finds a way to rescue us.

21
00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.405
Chuck: Yeah.

22
00:01:46.765 --> 00:01:49.226
And if he does, I will be very happy.

23
00:01:55.189 --> 00:02:00.611
Ant: I see that the trading mission was successful.

24
00:02:00.631 --> 00:02:03.292
Ant 1: Yes, the mites were telling the truth.

25
00:02:04.116 --> 00:02:05.517
They captured two humans.

26
00:02:05.577 --> 00:02:10.520
Official Ant: These are the smallest humans I have ever seen.

27
00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.581
Official Ant: It is extraordinary.

28
00:02:12.602 --> 00:02:15.243
Ant 1: I hope the queen will be pleased.

29
00:02:16.664 --> 00:02:17.725
Chuck: Queen?

30
00:02:17.745 --> 00:02:20.607
Dave: What does the queen want with us?

31
00:02:20.627 --> 00:02:24.989
Official Ant: Yes, the queen will be very happy to have humans in her zoo.

32
00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:26.891
Chuck Dave: Zoo!

33
00:02:27.551 --> 00:02:28.432
Oh no!

34
00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.940
Tina: So where are the bullies?

35
00:02:36.741 --> 00:02:37.581
Have you seen them?

36
00:02:37.601 --> 00:02:40.502
Brad: Yes, the mites captured them.

37
00:02:40.522 --> 00:02:42.542
Bello: That's terrible.

38
00:02:43.203 --> 00:02:45.283
We should go back inside and rescue them.

39
00:02:45.303 --> 00:02:47.324
Danny: We tried that already.

40
00:02:48.064 --> 00:02:49.784
The mites don't have them anymore.

41
00:02:49.804 --> 00:02:52.325
Bello: What happened to them?

42
00:02:52.345 --> 00:02:54.446
Brad: Now ants have them.

43
00:02:54.466 --> 00:02:55.786
Danny: Yeah.

44
00:02:56.166 --> 00:03:01.888
When we got inside the fort, we saw the mites sell [n3@the bullies to some ants─some big ants.

45
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.621
Tina: How are we going to find these ants?

46
00:03:06.442 --> 00:03:08.844
Danny: Ants make tunnels under the ground.

47
00:03:09.624 --> 00:03:11.486
It will be impossible to find them.

48
00:03:11.506 --> 00:03:13.627
Bello: Not so, Danny.

49
00:03:14.468 --> 00:03:15.548
I’m sure there’s a way.

50
00:03:15.568 --> 00:03:19.651
Brad: Ants also make trails above ground.

51
00:03:19.671 --> 00:03:22.173
Tina: That’s right, Brad.

52
00:03:22.853 --> 00:03:27.637
If we can spot some other ants─ Danny: We could follow them to their tunnels!

53
00:03:27.657 --> 00:03:30.079
Bello: Wonderful.

54
00:03:30.899 --> 00:03:31.860
Brad: Okay, everyone.

55
00:03:32.502 --> 00:03:34.579
Let’s start looking for ant trails.
